OL,3,GNEWSACouple still divided by football
OL,4,Aafter 60 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple married for 60 years have said
OL,7,Fthe only time they ever disagree with
OL,8,Feach other is when Liverpool play
OL,9,FEverton.
OL,11,FPat and Dave Hughes, who both live at
OL,12,FSt Joseph's Hospice in Thornton,
OL,13,FSefton, celebrated their diamond
OL,14,Fwedding anniversary on Friday, and said
OL,15,Fthey were congratulated by every member
OL,16,Fof staff.
OL,18,FThe couple, who share three children,
OL,19,Feight grandchildren, and three
OL,20,Fgreat-grandchildren, also received a
OL,21,Fpersonal message from the King and
OL,22,FQueen Camilla.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
